# Every secret Lines knows, by name; values are never written here. They
# live in secrets.age in the data directory (lines secrets …, or
# lines-admin on astarte), never in .env or the environment.
#
# Made by `secrets init` (the database's raw SQLCipher key):
LINES_DB_KEY=
# Made by `secrets web-key`, and given to Serafina as LINES_APP_KEY too:
LINES_APP_KEY=
# Made by `secrets mcp-token`; only the hash is kept here, Serafina has the
# token as LINES_MCP_TOKEN:
LINES_MCP_TOKEN_SHA256=
